  "title": "OpenVPN: Validate wrapped client key length against remaining bytes",
  "description": "Summary:\n\nIn dissect_openvpn(), wkc_len was parsed from the packet and subtracted from msg_length_remaining without boundary validation. If wkc_len exceeded the available remaining bytes, data_len became negative, causing proto_tree_add_item() to throw an exception and abort packet dissection.\n\nChanges:\n\n\\- Validated that parsed_wkc_len is at least 2 bytes and does not exceed msg_length_remaining before applying it to wkc_len and data_len.\n\n\\- Verified with tools/check_apis.py (0 warnings) and tools/check_typed_item_calls.py (0 warnings).",
