      "title": "OpenVPN: Use unsigned type for parsed_wkc_len to avoid sign comparison",
      "message": "OpenVPN: Use unsigned type for parsed_wkc_len to avoid sign comparison\n\n\nChange parsed_wkc_len to uint32_t to match msg_length_remaining\nand satisfy -Wsign-compare compiler checks.",
