      "title": "OpenVPN: Validate wrapped client key length against remaining bytes",
      "message": "OpenVPN: Validate wrapped client key length against remaining bytes\n\nIn dissect_openvpn(), wkc_len was extracted from the packet and subtracted from msg_length_remaining without boundary checks. If wkc_len was larger than msg_length_remaining or smaller than 2 bytes, data_len became negative, passing an invalid length to proto_tree_add_item() and causing a dissector exception.\n\nValidate that parsed_wkc_len is at least 2 bytes and does not exceed msg_length_remaining before setting wkc_len and data_len.",
      "author_name": "meel-ayush",
      "author_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-09-09T02:43:18.000+00:00",
